`cL_eq_omL` (torsion), **`omL_koszul`** (`2 omL_{CAB} = cL_{CAB} − cL_{ABC} + cL_{BCA}`), `cL_eq_ccontr`
(`cL_{CAB} = g(e_C, brk_{AB})`), **`riemFL_eq`** (frame curvature = `R_{abcd}` contracted with the frame), the frame
Weyl decomposition `weylF_eq`, frame symmetries and trace-freeness of `weylF`, and the frame form of IV's stress
`emStressF_eq`.
-/

